Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `values` cannot be moved while `result` is still looking into it
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/returned_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_move_2.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     consume(values)
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed
